---
// 首页轻量留资区块：客户只留姓名/邮箱/电话，留言非必填，便于销售后期主动联系。
// 与 InquiryForm 共用同一 Formspree 端点，通过 leadSource 隐藏字段在收件箱中区分来源。
import { localeFromPath, type Locale } from '../../i18n/locales';
import { t } from '../../i18n/ui';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = localeFromPath(Astro.url.pathname) } = Astro.props;
const dict = t(locale).lead;
const waFollowupHref = `https://wa.me/8618684324501?text=${encodeURIComponent(dict.waFollowupMessage)}`;
---

<section id="leave-contact" class="py-24 bg-brand-red text-white scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-black tracking-[0.3em] uppercase flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-8 h-[2px] bg-white"></span>
            {dict.eyebrow}
          </h2>
          <h3 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">{dict.title}</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg text-white/80 leading-relaxed">{dict.body}</p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {dict.bullets.map(item => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-bold">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div id="leadCaptureCard" class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">{dict.cardTitle}</h4>
        <form
          id="leadCaptureForm"
          class="space-y-5"
          data-i18n-sending={dict.sending}
          data-i18n-send={dict.submit}
          data-i18n-verify={dict.verifyRequired}
          data-i18n-failed={dict.submitFailed}
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="leadSource" value="Homepage Lead Capture" />

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
            <div>
              <label for="lead-name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">{dict.fullName}</label>
              <input type="text" id="lead-name" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-blue outline-none transition" placeholder="John Doe" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="lead-phone" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">{dict.phone}</label>
              <input type="tel" id="lead-phone" name="phone" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-blue outline-none transition" placeholder={dict.phonePlaceholder} />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="lead-email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">{dict.email}</label>
            <input type="email" id="lead-email" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-blue outline-none transition" placeholder="john@example.com" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="lead-message" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">{dict.message}</label>
            <textarea id="lead-message" name="message" rows="2" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-blue outline-none transition" placeholder={dict.messagePlaceholder}></textarea>
          </div>

          <!-- Cloudflare Turnstile Widget（生产环境 sitekey，与 InquiryForm 一致） -->
          <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAEF-SD39wEwlYPuN"></div>

          <button type="submit" id="leadSubmitBtn" class="w-full py-4 bg-brand-blue text-white font-bold rounded-xl hover:opacity-90 transition shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
            <span>{dict.submit}</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M10.894 2.553a1 1 0 00-1.788 0l-7 14a1 1 0 001.169 1.409l5-1.429A1 1 0 009 15.571V11a1 1 0 112 0v4.571a1 1 0 00.725.962l5 1.428a1 1 0 001.17-1.408l-7-14z" />
            </svg>
          </button>
          <p id="leadStatus" class="text-center text-sm mt-3 hidden"></p>
          <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">{dict.privacyNote}</p>
        </form>

        <!-- Success State -->
        <div id="leadSuccess" class="hidden text-center py-10">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-green-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-2">{dict.successTitle}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-md mx-auto">{dict.successBody}</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-5 mb-3">{dict.successWhatsappHint}</p>
          <a
            href={waFollowupHref}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-brand-blue text-white font-bold rounded-xl hover:opacity-90 transition shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
            {dict.chatWhatsapp}
          </a>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <button id="leadSendAnotherBtn" class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 hover:underline">{dict.sendAnother}</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>

<script>
  const leadForm = document.getElementById('leadCaptureForm') as HTMLFormElement;
  const leadCard = document.getElementById('leadCaptureCard') as HTMLElement;
  const leadStatus = document.getElementById('leadStatus');
  const leadSubmitBtn = document.getElementById('leadSubmitBtn') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const leadSuccess = document.getElementById('leadSuccess');
  const leadSendAnotherBtn = document.getElementById('leadSendAnotherBtn') as HTMLButtonElement;

  // 运行时文案由服务端按语言注入（data-i18n-*），脚本本身与语言无关
  const sendingText = leadForm?.dataset.i18nSending ?? 'Sending...';
  const sendText = leadForm?.dataset.i18nSend ?? 'Leave My Contact Info';
  const verifyText = leadForm?.dataset.i18nVerify ?? 'Please complete the verification check before sending.';
  const failedText = leadForm?.dataset.i18nFailed ?? 'Submission failed. Please try again or contact us via WhatsApp.';

  const resetTurnstile = () => {
    const w = window as any;
    if (typeof w.turnstile !== 'undefined') w.turnstile.reset();
  };

  leadSendAnotherBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    leadForm!.classList.remove('hidden');
    leadSuccess!.classList.add('hidden');
    resetTurnstile();
    leadStatus!.className = 'text-center text-sm mt-3 hidden';
  });

  // 首页同时存在两个 Turnstile 组件，必须按本卡片内的 widgetId 精确取 token，避免跨表单误读
  const getTurnstileToken = () => {
    const w = window as any;
    if (typeof w.turnstile !== 'undefined') {
      const widget = leadCard?.querySelector('.cf-turnstile') as HTMLElement | null;
      if (widget && widget.getAttribute('data-turnstile-widget-id')) {
        return w.turnstile.getResponse(widget.getAttribute('data-turnstile-widget-id')) || '';
      }
      return w.turnstile.getResponse() || '';
    }
    return '';
  };

  leadForm?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();

    const turnstileToken = getTurnstileToken();
    if (!turnstileToken) {
      leadStatus!.innerText = verifyText;
      leadStatus!.className = 'text-center text-sm mt-3 text-red-600 font-bold block';
      return;
    }

    leadSubmitBtn.disabled = true;
    leadSubmitBtn.innerText = sendingText;
    leadStatus!.className = 'text-center text-sm mt-3 hidden';

    const formData = new FormData(leadForm);
    const data = Object.fromEntries(formData.entries());
    // Formspree 服务端验证依赖 cf-turnstile-response 字段
    (data as any)['cf-turnstile-response'] = turnstileToken;

    try {
      const response = await fetch('https://formspree.io/f/mvzeyopz', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: {
          'Content-Type': 'application/json',
          'Accept': 'application/json'
        },
        body: JSON.stringify(data),
      });

      const result = await response.json();

      if (response.ok) {
        leadForm.classList.add('hidden');
        leadSuccess!.classList.remove('hidden');
        leadForm.reset();
        resetTurnstile();
      } else {
        throw new Error(result.errors?.map((err: any) => err.message).join(', ') || result.message || failedText);
      }
    } catch (err) {
      leadStatus!.innerText = 'Error: ' + (err as Error).message;
      leadStatus!.className = 'text-center text-sm mt-3 text-red-600 font-bold block';
    } finally {
      leadSubmitBtn.disabled = false;
      leadSubmitBtn.innerText = sendText;
    }
  });
</script>
